  <ferc:DisclosureOfRespondentAppearingInAnnualReportToTheStockholdersTextBlock id="f-26" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;These financial statements have been prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the FERC. These financial statements should be read in conjunction with our Annual Report on FERC Form 6 for the year ended December 31, 2025, which includes a summary of significant accounting policies and other disclosures. We have made normal and recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of the financial results for the interim period presented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfRespondentAppearingInAnnua